{"seq":28,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-scoped-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T10:29:35.665Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2e903b87571693673ea61456499e0fc403a66dae2d1920965cf97e8f3975418c","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","text":"Hi Pree, here's every Marrow Fieldworks ticket number I could find in those places:\n\nMoss's notes\n- #4409: recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, 06:00 flatbed intake). From Moss's digest \"Central handoffs next week\" (teams/team-central/digests/2026-01-02-central-handoffs.md), listed as a pre-handoff item Hollis flagged.\n- #4412: driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. Same digest.\n(FR-882 is in that digest too, but it belongs to Marrow Agrisupply, not Fieldworks. Moss's Central cheat sheet has no ticket numbers.)\n\n#central-random\n- PD-5302: Hollis posted on Oct 14 that it's one more Marrow Fieldworks ticket, for a follow-up from this week.\n- #8841, maybe: on Oct 13 Tobias said he flagged the West yard Door 2 double-booking on ticket #8841. That came up when Hollis asked about Tobias's dealer account, which I read as Marrow Fieldworks, but the message doesn't name the account. #8841 was also used for a Tansley Parcel ticket in early 2025, so please check with Tobias before you rely on it.\n\nThis week's chat\n- No other Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers came up this week in #central-random or the other channels you're in. #central-team, #general, #help-it-ops and #inc-tansley-carrier-api had nothing new this week."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
{"seq":29,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-scoped-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T10:29:42.378Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5dfd00c51c1375c6804176e7239cf9df83f2987ca7bacf7acb2ad39afe178e91","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","text":"I've sent Pree the list in our DM. These are the Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I found:\n\nFrom Moss's notes (his Jan 2 \"Central handoffs next week\" digest):\n  #4409: Gatehouse Check-In report keeps timing out at the Salina North yard.\n  #4412: a glitch in the text-message prompts sent to drivers staging combine trailers.\n  Moss's Central cheat sheet has no ticket numbers. The digest also lists FR-882, but that's Marrow Agrisupply, so I left it out.\n\nFrom #central-random:\n  PD-5302: Hollis posted on Oct 14 that it's another Marrow Fieldworks ticket, for a follow-up from this week.\n  #8841: I marked this one as uncertain. On Oct 13 Tobias said he flagged a door double-booking on #8841 when Hollis asked about Tobias's dealer account. The message never names the account. The same number was also used for a Tansley Parcel ticket in early 2025, so I asked Pree to check with Tobias.\n\nFrom this week's chat: I found nothing more. Nothing new was posted this week in #central-team, #general, #help-it-ops or #inc-tansley-carrier-api.\n\nI only used channels Pree is a member of and files she can open. The knowledge base turned up a few more Marrow Fieldworks tickets in older weekly updates and CRM notes, such as MFW-218 and #PD-88412. Those aren't in the three places she named, so I didn't include them."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","ts":"1792159200.000128"}}
